          "note": "A security researcher publicly identified admin loopholes in LayerZero and Stargate contracts immediately after the CEO spotlighted the same flaw in a rival bridge; the GriffinAI incident demonstrated an attacker exploiting a LayerZero peer's admin privileges to mint 5 billion tokens and extract $3M within 24 hours of launch.",
