          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "The DVN (Decentralized Verifier Network) framework lets any project bootstrap verifiers with any token, but message security is only as strong as each DVN's economic depth, creating a highly uneven trust surface across the 120+ supported chains.",
